# Playwright's own outputs. The repository's root .gitignore is the scaffold's
# and predates these tests, so they are declared here rather than by editing it.
#
# `test-results/` holds traces, screenshots and videos, and is written only for
# a failing test — a passing run leaves nothing behind. `playwright-report/` is
# the HTML reporter's output, which the default `list` reporter does not
# produce. Neither is worth committing: both are regenerated by re-running.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
